  ('cvh-033-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 33, 1, NULL, '22 Come (lit. go) with me; fetch the lantern 同我去;拈手燈黎 t''ung ngo hü; nim shau-tang lai

23 Where are my coat, boots and cap? 我件衫,我對靴,我頂帽喺邊處呢 ngo kin sham, ngo tui hö, ngo teng mo, hai pin ch''ü ni

24 They are put away 擠埋喳 tsai mai cha

25 Bring me a bottle of soda-water 拈一樽嗬囒水來我 nim yat tsun ho-lan-shui loi ngo

26 I want a pencil to write characters 我要一枝筆寫字 ngo iu yat chi pāt se tsz

27 Get paper, pens, ink, and an ink-slab 拈紙筆墨水,及墨硯黎 nim chi, păt, mük-shui kap māk-in, lai

28 Sweep the floor; that will do! 掃樓板,好咯 so lau-pan; ho lok!

29 Where is my penknife? 我張刀仔喺邊處呢 ngo cheung to-tsai hai pin ch''ü ni?

30 Cut the handkerchief with the scissors 使較剪剪手巾 shai kau-tsin tsin shau-kān

31 Put on your trowsers and coat 着褲着衫 cheuk fu, cheuk sham

32 Get my book and stick 拈我簿書及我枝鞭杆來 nim ngo po shü, kap ngo chi pin-kon loi', '22Come(lit.go)withme;fetchthelantern同我去;拈手燈黎t''ungngohü;nimshau-tanglai23Wherearemycoat,bootsandcap?我件衫,我對靴,我頂帽喺邊處呢ngokinsham,ngotuihö,ngotengmo,haipinch''üni24Theyareputaway擠埋喳tsaimaicha25Bringmeabottleofsoda-water拈一樽嗬囒水來我nimyattsunho-lan-shuiloingo26Iwantapenciltowritecharacters我要一枝筆寫字ngoiuyatchipātsetsz27Getpaper,pens,ink,andanink-slab拈紙筆墨水,及墨硯黎nimchi,păt,mük-shuikapmāk-in,lai28Sweepthefloor;thatwilldo!掃樓板,好咯solau-pan;holok!29Whereismypenknife?我張刀仔喺邊處呢ngocheungto-tsaihaipinch''üni?30Cutthehandkerchiefwiththescissors使較剪剪手巾shaikau-tsintsinshau-kān31Putonyourtrowsersandcoat着褲着衫cheukfu,cheuksham32Getmybookandstick拈我簿書及我枝鞭杆來nimngoposhü,kapngochipin-konloi', 'verified'),
  ('cvh-033-02', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 33, 2, 'LESSON X.', 'Chinese (adj.) 唐人嘅 t''ong yan ke'' Bell 鐘 chung

