  ('cvh-052-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 52, 1, NULL, '8 Do you like music? Can you ride? 你中意音樂唔呢, 你會騎馬唔會 ni chung-i yām-ngok ''m ni; ni ui k''e ma''m ui?

