8 Tell him to pay 呌佢還錢 kiu k''ü wan ts''in

9 Don''t stop him : he will throw 唔好攔住佢,佢想 ''m ho lan chü k''ü ; k''ü seung it away 擗佢出去 p''ek k''ü ch''ut hü

