  ('cvh-074-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 74, 1, NULL, '<table border="1"><tr><td>11 No; but I am thirsty and sleepy</td><td>唔見, 淨係見頸渴眼瞓啫</td><td>m kin; tsing hai kin keng hot ngan-fan che</td></tr><tr><td>12 Are they very sleepy</td><td>佢哋係實首眼瞓麽</td><td>k&#x27;ü-ti hai shat-shau ngan-fān me?</td></tr><tr><td>13 I don&#x27;t know; I see they are comfortable</td><td>我唔知,我見佢哋好舒服</td><td>ngo &#x27;m chi; ngo kin k&#x27;ü-ti ho shü fuk</td></tr><tr><td>14 I think that horse is well</td><td>我睇個隻馬都幾好</td><td>ngo t&#x27;ai ko p&#x27;it ma to ki ho</td></tr><tr><td>15 Will you hold that mare for me</td><td>請你牽住响隻馬乸</td><td>ts&#x27;ing ni hin chü ko chek ma-na&#x27;</td></tr><tr><td>16 Does he drink tea or wine?</td><td>佢飲茶只飲酒呢</td><td>k&#x27;ü yām ch&#x27;a chi yām tsau ni?</td></tr><tr><td>17 He does not drink wine; he smokes</td><td>佢唔飲酒,食烟啫</td><td>k&#x27;ü &#x27;m yām tsau; shik in che</td></tr><tr><td>18 Why does he not put on his clothes?</td><td>做乜佢唔着衫呢</td><td>tso măt k&#x27;ü &#x27;m cheuk sham ni?</td></tr><tr><td>19 He is sick, and must be assisted to put them on</td><td>佢有病,要人同佢着</td><td>k&#x27;ü yau peng, iu yan t&#x27;ung k&#x27;ü cheuk</td></tr><tr><td>20 What sort of sickness has he?</td><td>佢有乜病呢</td><td>k&#x27;ü yau măt peng ni?</td></tr><tr><td>21 He is very tired and cannot do anything</td><td>佢十分癐,唔做得事</td><td>k&#x27;ü shap-fan kuì, &#x27;m tso tāk sze</td></tr><tr><td>22 Are those words intelligible or not?</td><td>个句話明白唔呢</td><td>ko kü wa ming-pak &#x27;m ni?</td></tr><tr><td>23 Do you mean those written outside the box</td><td>你問响个箱外邊嘅字咩</td><td>ni mân ko-ko seung ngoi-pin ke tsz me?</td></tr><tr><td>24 No; I mean those in the book he is carrying</td><td>唔係,我問佢挾住個部書嘅字</td><td>&#x27;m hai; ngo mân k&#x27;ü kip chü ko po-shü ke tsz</td></tr><tr><td>25 Take that candle and set it there</td><td>拈個枝蠟燭放埋呢啲响處</td><td>nim ko chi lap-chuk fong mai ni ti ko-ch&#x27;ü</td></tr><tr><td>26 Tell all the people to wait together</td><td>呌各人等埋一齊</td><td>kiu kok yan táng mai yat ts&#x27;ai</td></tr><tr><td>27 What are they to do?</td><td>佢哋做乜野</td><td>k&#x27;ü-ti tso măt ye?</td></tr><tr><td>28 Tell them to look at those cows and pigs</td><td>話佢哋知,睇吓个的牛共猪</td><td>wa k&#x27;ü-ti chi; t&#x27;ai ha ko ti ngau kung chü</td></tr><tr><td>29 Will he ascend if he is told?</td><td>你呌佢上去,你估佢肯上唔呢</td><td>ni kiu k&#x27;ü sheung hü, ni ku k&#x27;ü hàng sheung &#x27;m ni?</td></tr></table>', '<tableborder="1"><tr><td>11No;butIamthirstyandsleepy</td><td>唔見,淨係見頸渴眼瞓啫</td><td>mkin;tsinghaikinkenghotngan-fanche</td></tr><tr><td>12Aretheyverysleepy</td><td>佢哋係實首眼瞓麽</td><td>k&#x27;ü-tihaishat-shaungan-fānme?</td></tr><tr><td>13Idon&#x27;tknow;Iseetheyarecomfortable</td><td>我唔知,我見佢哋好舒服</td><td>ngo&#x27;mchi;ngokink&#x27;ü-tihoshüfuk</td></tr><tr><td>14Ithinkthathorseiswell</td><td>我睇個隻馬都幾好</td><td>ngot&#x27;aikop&#x27;itmatokiho</td></tr><tr><td>15Willyouholdthatmareforme</td><td>請你牽住响隻馬乸</td><td>ts&#x27;ingnihinchükochekma-na&#x27;</td></tr><tr><td>16Doeshedrinkteaorwine?</td><td>佢飲茶只飲酒呢</td><td>k&#x27;üyāmch&#x27;achiyāmtsauni?</td></tr><tr><td>17Hedoesnotdrinkwine;hesmokes</td><td>佢唔飲酒,食烟啫</td><td>k&#x27;ü&#x27;myāmtsau;shikinche</td></tr><tr><td>18Whydoeshenotputonhisclothes?</td><td>做乜佢唔着衫呢</td><td>tsomătk&#x27;ü&#x27;mcheukshamni?</td></tr><tr><td>19Heissick,andmustbeassistedtoputthemon</td><td>佢有病,要人同佢着</td><td>k&#x27;üyaupeng,iuyant&#x27;ungk&#x27;ücheuk</td></tr><tr><td>20Whatsortofsicknesshashe?</td><td>佢有乜病呢</td><td>k&#x27;üyaumătpengni?</td></tr><tr><td>21Heisverytiredandcannotdoanything</td><td>佢十分癐,唔做得事</td><td>k&#x27;üshap-fankuì,&#x27;mtsotāksze</td></tr><tr><td>22Arethosewordsintelligibleornot?</td><td>个句話明白唔呢</td><td>koküwaming-pak&#x27;mni?</td></tr><tr><td>23Doyoumeanthosewrittenoutsidethebox</td><td>你問响个箱外邊嘅字咩</td><td>nimânko-koseungngoi-pinketszme?</td></tr><tr><td>24No;Imeanthoseinthebookheiscarrying</td><td>唔係,我問佢挾住個部書嘅字</td><td>&#x27;mhai;ngomânk&#x27;ükipchükopo-shüketsz</td></tr><tr><td>25Takethatcandleandsetitthere</td><td>拈個枝蠟燭放埋呢啲响處</td><td>nimkochilap-chukfongmainitiko-ch&#x27;ü</td></tr><tr><td>26Tellallthepeopletowaittogether</td><td>呌各人等埋一齊</td><td>kiukokyantángmaiyatts&#x27;ai</td></tr><tr><td>27Whataretheytodo?</td><td>佢哋做乜野</td><td>k&#x27;ü-titsomătye?</td></tr><tr><td>28Tellthemtolookatthosecowsandpigs</td><td>話佢哋知,睇吓个的牛共猪</td><td>wak&#x27;ü-tichi;t&#x27;aihakotingaukungchü</td></tr><tr><td>29Willheascendifheistold?</td><td>你呌佢上去,你估佢肯上唔呢</td><td>nikiuk&#x27;üsheunghü,nikuk&#x27;ühàngsheung&#x27;mni?</td></tr></table>', 'needs_review'),
  ('cvh-075-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 75, 1, NULL, '<table border="1"><tr><td>30 We don&#x27;t know; he is in the boat</td><td>我哋唔知,佢在三板嚟呢</td><td>ngo-ti &#x27;m chi; k&#x27;ü tsoi sam-pan lai ni</td></tr><tr><td>31 Tell him to brush my clothes</td><td>呌佢擦我嘅衣裳</td><td>kiu k&#x27;ü ts&#x27;at ngo ke i-sheung</td></tr><tr><td>32 Are you quite well to-day?</td><td>你今日實首好呀</td><td>ni kām-yat shat-shau ho a?</td></tr><tr><td>33 Yes, but I was very unwell yesterday</td><td>係咯,但係昨日十分唔自然</td><td>hai lok, tan hai tsok-yat shap-fān &#x27;m tsz-in</td></tr><tr><td>34 Sit down and listen to me</td><td>你坐處等我話你知</td><td>ni tsoh chü, tang ngo wa ni chi</td></tr><tr><td>35 Is that a cock or a hen?</td><td>個隻鷄係公只係乸呢</td><td>ko chek kai hai kung chi hai na ni?</td></tr><tr><td>36 I don&#x27;t know anything of birds</td><td>我唔曉得分雀公雀乸呢</td><td>ngo &#x27;m hiu tāk fan tseuk-kung tseuk-na ke</td></tr><tr><td>37 You are not looking at them</td><td>你都唔係睇住佢</td><td>ni to &#x27;m hai t&#x27;ai chü k&#x27;ü</td></tr><tr><td>38 I think it is a hen; but I don&#x27;t know</td><td>我估係乸,但唔知得實</td><td>ngo ku hai na; tan &#x27;m chi tāk shat</td></tr><tr><td>39 Where can I get a pair of sheets?</td><td>我去邊處攞得倒一對被單呢</td><td>ngo hü pin-ch&#x27;ü lo tāk to yat tui p&#x27;i-tan ni?</td></tr><tr><td>40 You (polite form) can get them upstairs</td><td>罵上上樓攞得倒咯</td><td>Ka sheung sheung lau lo tāk to lok</td></tr></table>', '<tableborder="1"><tr><td>30Wedon&#x27;tknow;heisintheboat</td><td>我哋唔知,佢在三板嚟呢</td><td>ngo-ti&#x27;mchi;k&#x27;ütsoisam-panlaini</td></tr><tr><td>31Tellhimtobrushmyclothes</td><td>呌佢擦我嘅衣裳</td><td>kiuk&#x27;üts&#x27;atngokei-sheung</td></tr><tr><td>32Areyouquitewellto-day?</td><td>你今日實首好呀</td><td>nikām-yatshat-shauhoa?</td></tr><tr><td>33Yes,butIwasveryunwellyesterday</td><td>係咯,但係昨日十分唔自然</td><td>hailok,tanhaitsok-yatshap-fān&#x27;mtsz-in</td></tr><tr><td>34Sitdownandlistentome</td><td>你坐處等我話你知</td><td>nitsohchü,tangngowanichi</td></tr><tr><td>35Isthatacockorahen?</td><td>個隻鷄係公只係乸呢</td><td>kochekkaihaikungchihainani?</td></tr><tr><td>36Idon&#x27;tknowanythingofbirds</td><td>我唔曉得分雀公雀乸呢</td><td>ngo&#x27;mhiutākfantseuk-kungtseuk-nake</td></tr><tr><td>37Youarenotlookingatthem</td><td>你都唔係睇住佢</td><td>nito&#x27;mhait&#x27;aichük&#x27;ü</td></tr><tr><td>38Ithinkitisahen;butIdon&#x27;tknow</td><td>我估係乸,但唔知得實</td><td>ngokuhaina;tan&#x27;mchitākshat</td></tr><tr><td>39WherecanIgetapairofsheets?</td><td>我去邊處攞得倒一對被單呢</td><td>ngohüpin-ch&#x27;ülotāktoyattuip&#x27;i-tanni?</td></tr><tr><td>40You(politeform)cangetthemupstairs</td><td>罵上上樓攞得倒咯</td><td>Kasheungsheunglaulotāktolok</td></tr></table>', 'needs_review'),
  ('cvh-075-02', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 75, 2, 'LESSON XXVII.', 'To fill it up 裝滿佢, tsong mun'' k''ü'', To reflect 思想 see seung''

