16 Tell the coolie to follow the 話個管店知跟住响 wa ko kun-tim chi kan-chü ko-troops 啲兵 ti ping

17 His heart is bad, but he fears 佢嘅心唔好,但係 k''ü ke sàm ''m ho, tan hai k''ü

me 佢怕我 p''a ngo

18 There is a scaffolding by the 响幅磚牆邊有個竹 ko-fuk chün ts''eung pin yau ko side of the brick wall 棚 chuk-p''āng

19 It is not a brick wall, it is a 响幅唔係磚牆,係 ko fuk ''m hai chün-ts''eung, hai mud wall 坭牆啫 nai-ts''eung che

20 Get the key for this lock 揾呢把鎖嘅鎖匙嚟 wan ni pa-soh ke soh-shi lai

21 Why do you want to stop up 爲乜野你要塞住响 wai-mät-ye ni iu sak chü ko to the door? 度門口 mun-hau

22 It has no hinges, and besides, 佢冇較嘅,而且又 k''ü mo kan ke, i-ch''e yau lan it''s broken爛嘵咯 hiu lok

23 Choose the good ones quickly 快快揀啲好嘅 fai-fai kān ti ho ke

24 Why should I do it quickly? 爲乜我要咁快做啫 wai-mät ngo iu kom fai tso che

25 Because I want to pay a visit 因爲我要去探一個 yan-wai ngo iu hü t''am yat ko to a person 人 yan

26 Tell the boy to read it呌個細紋仔大聲 kiu ko sai-man-tsai tai shing aloud 讀 tuk

