  ('cvh-090-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 90, 1, NULL, '28 Why? does he want to go to 爲乜事呢,佢係想 wai-mät-sz ni? k''ü hai seung hü sleep? 去瞓咩 fan me?

29 No, he wants to accompany 唔係, 佢想去送朋 ''m hai, k''ü seung hü sung p''āng-

his friends 友啫 yau che

30 He cannot accompany them; 佢唔去送得,呌佢 k''ü ''m hü seung tǎk; kiu k''ü call him here 嚟呢處 lai ni ch''ü

31 Why won''t you give a little 乜野你唔俾啲添呢 mät-ye ni ''m pi ti t''im ni? more?

32 I have not enough money; I 我唔够銀; 唔敢做 ngo ''m kau ngăn; ''m kom tso dare uot do it 咯 lok

33 Suppose I give it to you? 若係我俾啲你呢 yeuk hai ngo pi ti ni ni?

34 You are very good; I thank 你真正好咯, 我多

you 謝你 ni chān ching ho lok; ngo to tse ni

35 I wish you would go and wake 我想你去呌醒佢 ngo seung ni hü kiu sing k''ü him up 啫 che

36 He has not come here for a 佢唔曾來呢處好久 k''ü ''m ts''ang loi ni-ch''ü ho kau long time咯 lok

37 Is there any body in the個客廳有人喺處ko hak-t''eng yau yau hai ch''ü drawing-room?冇mo?

38 There are a good many people 响處有好多人 ko-ch''ü yau ho to yan

39 Are they all rich people? 一總都係財主佬唔 yat tsung to hai ts''oi-chü lo ''m係呢 hai ni?

