  ('cvh-094-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 94, 1, NULL, '<table border="1"><tr><td>28 Open the window door(Frenchwindow)a little</td><td>開响度窓門一的咁多</td><td>hoi ko to ch''eung-mun yat tik kom to</td></tr><tr><td>29 Take care!don''t fall down</td><td>予細吓,咪跌倒</td><td>tsz sai ha! mai tit to</td></tr><tr><td>30 Have you put your boots onagain</td><td>你有着翻你對靴未曾呀</td><td>ni yau cheuk fan ni tui hö mi ts&#x27;ang a?</td></tr><tr><td>31 No,I put on my shoes</td><td>冇,我着鞋啫</td><td>mo,ngo cheuk hai che</td></tr><tr><td>32 At what time do you go toschool?</td><td>你幾多點鐘去書館</td><td>ni ki to tim chung hü shü-kun?</td></tr><tr><td>33 I go when I come from theshop</td><td>我喺舖頭番來就去咯</td><td>ngo hai p&#x27;o-t&#x27;au fan loi chau hü lok</td></tr><tr><td>34 Did you see any one at thePost office?</td><td>書信館响處你見有人冇呀</td><td>shu-sän-kun ko-ch&#x27;ü, ni kin yau yan mo a?</td></tr><tr><td>35 No,I saw several people inthe market</td><td>冇,我見街市有幾個人</td><td>mo,ngo kin kai-shi yau ki ko yau</td></tr><tr><td>36 What are you doing with thatlump of dough?</td><td>你擰响團麵粉做乜野呢</td><td>ni ning ko t&#x27;ün min-fan tso mät ye ni?</td></tr><tr><td>37 I am going to make bread of it</td><td>我將佢嚟整麵包</td><td>ngo tseung k&#x27;ü lai ching min-pau</td></tr><tr><td>38 Fetch me a ladder quickly</td><td>快啲担把梯來</td><td>fai-ti tam pa-t&#x27;ai loi</td></tr><tr><td>39 It was very wrong to do so</td><td>噉做係十分錯咯</td><td>kom tso hai shap-fan ts&#x27;oh lok</td></tr></table>

40 Bring your bill to me to-morrow 明日你擰單嚟喇 ming-yat ni ning tan lai la', '<tableborder="1"><tr><td>28Openthewindowdoor(Frenchwindow)alittle</td><td>開响度窓門一的咁多</td><td>hoikotoch''eung-munyattikkomto</td></tr><tr><td>29Takecare!don''tfalldown</td><td>予細吓,咪跌倒</td><td>tszsaiha!maititto</td></tr><tr><td>30Haveyouputyourbootsonagain</td><td>你有着翻你對靴未曾呀</td><td>niyaucheukfannituihömits&#x27;anga?</td></tr><tr><td>31No,Iputonmyshoes</td><td>冇,我着鞋啫</td><td>mo,ngocheukhaiche</td></tr><tr><td>32Atwhattimedoyougotoschool?</td><td>你幾多點鐘去書館</td><td>nikitotimchunghüshü-kun?</td></tr><tr><td>33IgowhenIcomefromtheshop</td><td>我喺舖頭番來就去咯</td><td>ngohaip&#x27;o-t&#x27;aufanloichauhülok</td></tr><tr><td>34DidyouseeanyoneatthePostoffice?</td><td>書信館响處你見有人冇呀</td><td>shu-sän-kunko-ch&#x27;ü,nikinyauyanmoa?</td></tr><tr><td>35No,Isawseveralpeopleinthemarket</td><td>冇,我見街市有幾個人</td><td>mo,ngokinkai-shiyaukikoyau</td></tr><tr><td>36Whatareyoudoingwiththatlumpofdough?</td><td>你擰响團麵粉做乜野呢</td><td>niningkot&#x27;ünmin-fantsomätyeni?</td></tr><tr><td>37Iamgoingtomakebreadofit</td><td>我將佢嚟整麵包</td><td>ngotseungk&#x27;ülaichingmin-pau</td></tr><tr><td>38Fetchmealadderquickly</td><td>快啲担把梯來</td><td>fai-titampa-t&#x27;ailoi</td></tr><tr><td>39Itwasverywrongtodoso</td><td>噉做係十分錯咯</td><td>komtsohaishap-fants&#x27;ohlok</td></tr></table>40Bringyourbilltometo-morrow明日你擰單嚟喇ming-yatniningtanlaila', 'verified'),
