uese</td><td>西洋人</td><td>sai-yeungyan</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></table>BysubstitutingKWOK國forYAN人thenameofthecountryisexpressed,KWOK國meaningastate,country,kingdom.Theword"world"abovegiven,isintheChineseclassicsusedonlytodesignateChina,ortheempireparexcellence.<table><tr><td>Tostayatonin</td><td>在處住</td><td>tsoi''ch''ü''chü''</td></tr><tr><td>Tosneeze</td><td>打嚇哆</td><td>ta''hat-ch''i</td></tr><tr><td>Togape</td><td>打喊露</td><td>ta''ham''lo''</td></tr><tr><td>Tosailto</td><td>駛去</td><td>shai''hü''</td></tr><tr><td>Togoto</td><td>開去</td><td>hoihü''</td></tr><tr><td>Toleaveaplace</td><td>離開</td><td>li-hoi</td></tr><tr><td>wearspectacles</td><td>我帶眼鏡</td><td>ngo''tai''ngan''-keng''</td></tr><tr><td>amtakingtiffin-</td><td>我食晏晝</td><td>ngo''shikan''-chan''</td></tr><tr><td>itisadissyllable-</td><td>係蜆壳字</td><td>hai''hin''-hok-tsi''</td></tr></table>', 'verified'),
