  ('cvh-104-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 104, 1, NULL, '6 Where does that man intend 响個人想打路去邊 ko-ko yan seung ta lo hü pin to travel? 處遊呢 ch''ü yau ni?

