8 Do you think he will first你估佢先拜神係 ni ku k''ü sin pai shǎn hai ''m worship the spirits? 唔呢 ni?

9 I suppose so; he sails to

morrow 斷估都係喇,佢聽日開身 tün ku to hai la; k''ü t''ing-yat hoi shan

10 Did the executioner kill the個殺手佬殺响個ko shat-shau-lo shat ko-ko yan man? 人咩 me?

11 The Governor ordered him to 個總督命佢殺响個 ko tsung-tuk ming k''ü shat ko-

kill the farmer耕田佬ko kang-t''in lo

