  ('cvh-111-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 111, 1, NULL, 'Newspaper 新文紙 sān-män-chi'' Physician 醫生 i-shǎng

Filferer 三隻手 sam-chek-shau'' Pirate 海賊 hai''ts''ak

Do. 小手 siu''-shau'' Pleased 歡喜 fun-hi''

Letter 書信 shü-sun'' Very, extremely 極 kik

1 I shall be very pleased to see 我極歡喜在我嘅屋 ngo kik fun-hi tsoi ngo-ke uk you at my house 見你 kin ni

2 Of what country is that 嗰個人係乜國嘅 ko-ko yan hai măt kwok ke man? 呢 ni?

3 He is a countryman of mine 佢係我同國嘅人 k''ü hai ngo t''ung kwok ke yan

4 My (humble) surname is Ho 小姓何 siu sing Ho

5 Did he bring a letter? 佢有帶封信來有呢 k''ü yau tai fung-sun loi mo ni?

6 Yes; he gave it to your fa- 有, 佢俾嘵你嘅父 yau; k''ü pi hiu ni ke fu-ts''än ther 親咯 lok

7 How many quires of paper 你有幾多刀紙呢 ni yau ki to to chi ni?

have you?

8 I have no paper, I have six 我有紙，有六部書 ngo mo chi, yau luk po shü volumes of books 啫 che

9 Have you seen two plays? 你睇嘵兩套戲咩 ni t''ai hiu leung t''o-hi me?

10 I saw two plays; did your 我睇嘵兩套戲；你 ngo t''ai hiu leung t''o hi; ni ke brother see them? 嘅兄弟有睇冇 hing-tai yau t''ai mo?

11 Will the boy (servant) hold 嗰個事仔肯同我牽 ko-ko sze-tsai hàng t''ung ngo hin my horse? 住匹馬唔呢 chü p''at ma ''m ni?

12 Bring the ink and inkstand, 拈墨共墨硯來，我 nim mak kung mak-in loi, ngo I want to write 要寫野 iu se ye

13 Has the inkstone no box or 嗰個墨硯冇盒或冇 ko-ko mak-in mo hap wak mo cover? 蓋嘅咩 k''oi ke me?

14 Yes; they are on the ink-有，個的喺墨硯盆 yau; ko-tik hai mak-in-p''un stone tray 嚟 lai

15 That is a foreign inkstand; I 嗰個係來路嘅墨水 ko-ko hai loi-lo ke mak-shui-ang;

want an inkstone 鑑; 我要個墨硯 ngo in ko mak-in

16 I am going to write two let- 我如今要寫兩封信 ngo ü-kam in se leung fung-ters now sun', 'Newspaper新文紙sān-män-chi''Physician醫生i-shǎngFilferer三隻手sam-chek-shau''Pirate海賊hai''ts''akDo.小手siu''-shau''Pleased歡喜fun-hi''Letter書信shü-sun''Very,extremely極kik1Ishallbeverypleasedtosee我極歡喜在我嘅屋ngokikfun-hitsoingo-keukyouatmyhouse見你kinni2Ofwhatcountryisthat嗰個人係乜國嘅ko-koyanhaimătkwokkeman?呢ni?3Heisacountrymanofmine佢係我同國嘅人k''ühaingot''ungkwokkeyan4My(humble)surnameisHo小姓何siusingHo5Didhebringaletter?佢有帶封信來有呢k''üyautaifung-sunloimoni?6Yes;hegaveittoyourfa-有,佢俾嘵你嘅父yau;k''üpihiunikefu-ts''änther親咯lok7Howmanyquiresofpaper你有幾多刀紙呢niyaukitotochini?haveyou?8Ihavenopaper,Ihavesix我有紙，有六部書ngomochi,yaulukposhüvolumesofbooks啫che9Haveyouseentwoplays?你睇嘵兩套戲咩nit''aihiuleungt''o-hime?10Isawtwoplays;didyour我睇嘵兩套戲；你ngot''aihiuleungt''ohi;nikebrotherseethem?嘅兄弟有睇冇hing-taiyaut''aimo?11Willtheboy(servant)hold嗰個事仔肯同我牽ko-kosze-tsaihàngt''ungngohinmyhorse?住匹馬唔呢chüp''atma''mni?12Bringtheinkandinkstand,拈墨共墨硯來，我nimmakkungmak-inloi,ngoIwanttowrite要寫野iuseye13Hastheinkstonenoboxor嗰個墨硯冇盒或冇ko-komak-inmohapwakmocover?蓋嘅咩k''oikeme?14Yes;theyareontheink-有，個的喺墨硯盆yau;ko-tikhaimak-in-p''unstonetray嚟lai15Thatisaforeigninkstand;I嗰個係來路嘅墨水ko-kohailoi-lokemak-shui-ang;wantaninkstone鑑;我要個墨硯ngoinkomak-in16Iamgoingtowritetwolet-我如今要寫兩封信ngoü-kaminseleungfung-tersnowsun', 'needs_review'),
  ('cvh-112-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 112, 1, NULL, '17 The pilot is on board the ship 個帶水人喺船嚟 ko tai-shui-yan hai shun lai

18 Do they not fear pirates? 佢哋唔怕海賊咩 k''ü-ti ''m p''a hoi-ts''ak me?

19 The police seized the pilferer 嗰啲差役捉倒個小 ko-ti ch''ai-yik chuk to ko siu-shau

20 This man is very ill; call a 呢個人病十分重; ni-ko yan peng shap-fan chung; doctor 請個醫生嚟喇 ts''ing ko i-shang lai la

21 Take these things to the 擰呢啲野去個當舖 ning ni-ti ye hü ko tong-p''o-lo pawnhroker佬處 ch''ü

22 Does the pastrycook make 嗰個麵食師傅噲整 ko-ko mio-shik-sze-fu ui ching cakes? 餅唔呢 peng ''m ni?

