  ('cvh-126-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 126, 1, NULL, '1 What sort of weather have you 你喺省城時天氣點 ni hai shang-shing shi t''in-hi tim at Canton? 樣呀 yeung a?

