  ('cvh-139-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 139, 1, NULL, '<table border="1"><tr><td>30 Whilst I go, you observe him</td><td>我一面去，你睇住佢喇</td><td>ngo yat min hüi, ni t&#x27;ai chü k&#x27;ü la</td></tr><tr><td>31 Put the sponge in the hot water</td><td>擠個水泡落熱水嚟</td><td>chai ko shui-p&#x27;o lok it-shui lai</td></tr><tr><td>32 Thero is some disagreement between those men</td><td>嗰啲人唔同一心嘅</td><td>ko-ti yan &#x27;m t&#x27;ung yat sām ke</td></tr><tr><td>33 Is the box on the ship&#x27;s deck?</td><td>個箱喺船面咩</td><td>ko seung hai shūn-min me?</td></tr><tr><td>34 Is he addicted to breaking things?</td><td>佢好打爛野嘅咩</td><td>k&#x27;ü ho ta-lan ye ke me?</td></tr><tr><td>35 That ship has a very heavy cargo</td><td>嗰隻船載有好重嘅貨</td><td>ko chek shün tsoi yau ho chung ke foh</td></tr><tr><td>36 There is no room for more</td><td>冇地方載多啲添咯</td><td>mo ti-fong tsoi to ti t&#x27;im lok</td></tr><tr><td>37 Put some of the things in the cabin</td><td>擠啲野在嗰廂房嚟</td><td>chai ti ye tsoi ko seung-fong lai</td></tr><tr><td>38 I&#x27;m not able to! there are too many men there</td><td>我不能，嗰處巳經有好多人咯</td><td>ngo pät nāng! ko ch&#x27;ü i-king yau ho to yan lok</td></tr><tr><td>39 More than I ever saw in my whole life</td><td>多過我一生所見嘅</td><td>to kwo ngo yat shǎng sho kin ke</td></tr><tr><td>40 Tell him he ought to tack ship</td><td>話佢知；佢應該掘篷喇</td><td>wa k&#x27;ü chi; k&#x27;ü ying-koi k&#x27;au p&#x27;ung la</td></tr></table>', '<tableborder="1"><tr><td>30WhilstIgo,youobservehim</td><td>我一面去，你睇住佢喇</td><td>ngoyatminhüi,nit&#x27;aichük&#x27;üla</td></tr><tr><td>31Putthespongeinthehotwater</td><td>擠個水泡落熱水嚟</td><td>chaikoshui-p&#x27;olokit-shuilai</td></tr><tr><td>32Theroissomedisagreementbetweenthosemen</td><td>嗰啲人唔同一心嘅</td><td>ko-tiyan&#x27;mt&#x27;ungyatsāmke</td></tr><tr><td>33Istheboxontheship&#x27;sdeck?</td><td>個箱喺船面咩</td><td>koseunghaishūn-minme?</td></tr><tr><td>34Isheaddictedtobreakingthings?</td><td>佢好打爛野嘅咩</td><td>k&#x27;ühota-lanyekeme?</td></tr><tr><td>35