  ('cvh-146-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 146, 1, NULL, '20 Is this rice first or second呢啲米係第一等只 ni-ti mai hai tai yat tăng, chi ta quality? 第二等嘅呢 i tăng ke ni?

21 Do women wear aprons? 女人着圍裙嘅咩 nü-yan cheuk wai-kw''än ke me?

22 Chinese women do not; Fo-唐人女人唔着; 外 T''ong-yan nü-yan ''m cheuk; ngoi-reign women wear them 國女人着啫 kwok nü-yan cheuk che

23 Have you gold buttons on 你嘅衣服有金鈕 ni ke i-fuk yau kom nau mo your clothes? 冇呢 ni?

24 How many sorts of caps are 有幾多樣帽呢 yau ki to yeung mo ni? there?

25 Nearly all caps come from Can- 差不多咁多帽都係 ch''a-pat-to kom to mo to hai tou (i.e. the provincial city) 省城來嘅 Shang-shing loi ke

26 They are all first quality 一啲帽都係第一 yat ti mo to hai tai yat tăng caps 等嘅 ke

27 The gloves I bought last are 我收尾買個對手笠 ngo shau-mi mai ko tui shau-lap the best 係至好嘅 hai chi ho ke

28 Do they sell Japanese (Yat pun 佢哋賣日本嘅修飾 k''ü-ti mai Yat-pun ke sau-shik- ke) dressing gowns (here)? 衫咩 sham me?

29 They sell English handkerchiefs 佢哋賣英國嘅手巾 k''ü-ti mai Ying-kwok ke shau-kān

30 That head-dress is very hand-個啲首飾係十分 ko-ti shau-shik hai shap-fān ho some 好睇 t''ai

31 Does that house leak much? 嗰間屋好漏嘅咩 ko kan uk ho lau ke me?

32 It leaks a great deal when it 落雨時就十分漏 lok ü shi tsau shap-fān lau rains咯 lok

33 Do you think that is use你估嗰啲係冇用嘅 ni ku ko-ti hai mo yung ke less? 咩 me?

34 It is of no great importance 唔係十分交關啫 ''m hai shap-fān kau-kwan che

35 How many sorts of pins have 你有幾多樣嘅大頭 ni yau ki to yeung ke tai-t''au you? 針呢 chām ni?

36 I have several in my pocket 我嘅袋有幾眼啫 ngo ke toi yau ki ngan che

37 That affair should be quickly 嗰件事應該趕快 ko kin-sze ying-koi kon-fai tso finished做完喇 ün la', '20Isthisricefirstorsecond呢啲米係第一等只ni-timaihaitaiyattăng,chitaquality?第二等嘅呢ităngkeni?21Dowomenwearaprons?女人着圍裙嘅咩nü-yancheukwai-kw''änkeme?22Chinesewomendonot;Fo-唐人女人唔着;外T''ong-yannü-yan''mcheuk;ngoi-reignwomenwearthem國女人着啫kwoknü-yancheukche23Haveyougoldbuttonson你嘅衣服有金鈕nikei-fukyaukomnaumoyourclothes?冇呢ni?24Howmanysortsofcapsare有幾多樣帽呢yaukitoyeungmoni?there?25NearlyallcapscomefromCan-差不多咁多帽都係ch''a-pat-tokomtomotohaitou(i.e.theprovincialcity)省城來嘅Shang-shingloike26Theyareallfirstquality一啲帽都係第一yattimotohaitaiyattăngcaps等嘅ke27TheglovesIboughtlastare我收尾買個對手笠ngoshau-mimaikotuishau-lapthebest係至好嘅haichihoke28DotheysellJapanese(Yatpun佢哋賣日本嘅修飾k''ü-timaiYat-punkesau-shik-ke)dressinggowns(here)?衫咩shamme?29TheysellEnglishhandkerchiefs佢哋賣英國嘅手巾k''ü-timaiYing-kwokkeshau-kān30Thathead-dressisveryhand-個啲首飾係十分ko-tishau-shikhaishap-fānhosome好睇t''ai31Doesthathouseleakmuch?嗰間屋好漏嘅咩kokanukholaukeme?32Itleaksagreatdealwhenit落雨時就十分漏loküshitsaushap-fānlaurains咯lok33Doyouthinkthatisuse你估嗰啲係冇用嘅nikuko-tihaimoyungkeless?咩me?34Itisofnogreatimportance唔係十分交關啫''mhaishap-fānkau-kwanche35Howmanysortsofpinshave你有幾多樣嘅大頭niyaukitoyeungketai-t''auyou?針呢chāmni?36Ihaveseveralinmypocket我嘅袋有幾眼啫ngoketoiyaukinganche37Thataffairshouldbequickly嗰件事應該趕快kokin-szeying-koikon-faitsofinished做完喇ünla', 'needs_review'),
  ('cvh-147-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 147, 1, NULL, '38 Does your head pain you? 你嘅頭令你痛咩 ni-ke t''au ling ni t''ung me?

39 Not very much; but I am unwell 唔係十分痛啫，但係我唔精神 ''m hai shap-fān t''ung che; tan hai ngo ''m tsing-shān

