rows or objects, with interstices between them, such as balustrades, trees, &c.

65. Hou'' 口 a mouth, an opening.,

things with sharp edges, swords, &c.

66. Min'' 面 a surface, the face, , gongs, looking-glasses, banners, &c.

We have all kinds of goods 我哋各樣貨都有 ngo''-ti kok yeung'' foh'' to yau''

