  ('cvh-154-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 154, 1, NULL, '21 People say he is much to be 人哋話佢係十分可 yan-ti wa k''ü hai shap-fan ho pitied 憐嘅 lin ke

