  ('cvh-161-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 161, 1, NULL, '7 What sort of climate has 省城水土點樣呢 Shang-shing shui-t''o tim yeung Canton? ni?

8 Not very good; the climate 唔係十分好; 個水 ''m hai shap-fān ho; ko shui-t''o does not suit me 土唔合我嘅 ''m hop ngo ke

9 The ship goes on the ebb tide, 响隻船趁水乾時去 ko chek shün ts''än shui kon shi but with a fair wind 又遇順風 hü, yau ü shun fung

10 The Captain of the ship is on deck 船主在船面嚟 shün-chü tsoi shün-min lai

11 Has that steamer anchored

yet?

响隻火船抛錨未

曾呢

ko chek foh-shün p''au nan mi

ts''äng ni?

