13 Do you speak Chinese? I speak 你噲講唐話咩, 我 ni ui kong T''ong-wa me? ngo yau

it sometimes 有時都講 shi to kong

14 What is the meaning of that 响個字母係點解 ko-ko tsz-mo hai tim kai ni? radical? 呢

15 Put it in writing for me to 寫落字使我明白 se lok tsz shai ngo ming-pak make it plain (ming-pak)

16 Is that your business? 响啲係你嘅工夫咩 ko-ti hai ni ke kung-fu me?

17 It is not my business; I have 唔係我嘅事, 我有 m'' hai ngo ke sze, ngo yau fān to do with plays 份做戲啫 tso hi che

18 Are there many fish in that 响個海有好多魚 ko-ko hoi yau ho to ü me?

sea? 咩

19 Where does Beche-de-mer 海參係邊處來嘅 hoi-shām hai pin-ch''ü loi ke come from呢 ni?

20 Are beef-steaks roasted or牛肉鈀係煎嘅或膾ngau-yuk-p''a hai tsin ke wak stewed? 嘅呢 ui ke ni?

21 They are always fired 喊嘭哈都係煎嘅多 ham-pang-lan to hai tsin ke to

22 Do you like curried fowl or 你中意架喱鷄或架 ni chung-i ka-li-kai wak ka-li-curried duck? 喱鴨呢 ap ni?

23 I do not like either, I prefer 兩樣我都唔中意, 我中意蛋啫 leung yeung ngo to ''m chung-i,

eggs ngo chung-i tan che

