  ('cvh-165-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 165, 1, NULL, '10 Things are very dear now-a-近日物件十分貴 kan-yat mat-kin shap-fan kwai days

11 I will not punish him this time 呢陳我唔責罰佢 ni chān ngo ''m chak-fat k''ü

12 That tree is there to this 响樖樹至到今日都 ko p''oh shü chi to kām-yat to day 重喺處 chung hai ch''ü

13 What is the difference between 日頭日間兩句話有 "yat-t''au" "yat-kan" leung kü the expression "day-time" 分乜別呢 wa yau mät fān-pit ni? and "by day"

14 There is very little difference 响兩句說話好少分 ko leung kü shüt-wa ho shiu fān-between the expressions 別啫 pit che

15 He does work both by day and 佢日夜都做工夫 k''ü yat ye to tso kung-fu by night

16 Is he now working for 佢如今同你做工 k''ü ü-kām t''ung ni tso kung-fu you? 夫咩 me?

17 How many inches long is that? 有幾多寸長呢 yau ki to ts''ün ch''eung ni?

18 It is nearly a foot long 一尺長差不多 yat ch''ek ch''eung ch''a-pat-to

19 How mauy inches go to a foot? 幾多寸成一尺 ki to ts''ün shing yat ch''ek?

20 A foot has ten Chinese and twelve foreign inches 唐人十寸爲一尺; 外國人十二寸爲一尺 T''ong-yan shap ts''ün wai yat ch''ek; ngoi-kwok yau shap i ts''ün wai yat ch''ek

21 Did that comprador buy a 响個買辦買嘵一隻 ko-ko mai-pan mai hiu yat chek fowl and a wild goose? 鷄共一隻鴈鵝咩 kai kung yat chek ngan-ngo me?

22 No, he only bonght lobsters 冇, 佢獨係買得龍 mo, k''ü tuk hai mai täk lung-ha and fish 蝦共魚啫 kung ü che

23 Do you want to buy salt fish 你要買鹹魚只鮑 ni iu mai ham-ü chi pau-ü or shell fish? 魚呢 ni?

24 No matter what sort, but buy 唔論邊樣但係今日 ''m lun pin yeung tan hai kām-

some to-day 買嘅 yat mai ke

25 Did you ever get milk from 你舊時有同响個人 ni kau-shi yau t''ung ko-ko yan mai that man? 買牛奶冇呢 ngau-nai mo ni?

