  ('cvh-168-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 168, 1, NULL, 'How was it at last? 到底點樣呢 to'' tai'' tim'' yeung'' ni?

Everything is agreeable 件件都啱 kin'' kin'' to ngam

Love others as yourself 愛人如己 oi'' yan ü kü''

Afraid it can''t be attained 怕都唔得 p''o to ''m tāk

Very wet and dirty 濕濕湆湆 shäp-shäp nap-nap

To throw one''s whole heart into 一片苦心 yat p''in'' fu''-säm

Rather indisposed 唔多舒服 ''m to shu-fuk

It is so - 係噉嘅 hai'' kom'' ke''

Do. - 有噉嘅 yau'' kom'' ke''

All sorts - 樣樣 yeung'' yeung''

Anchorage 拋船地方 p''au shün ti- fong

Auction (to sell by) 投賣 t''au-mai''

Do. 埠頭 fau''-t''au

Do. 夜冷 ye''-lang

Arrow 箭 tsin''

To square an account 算賬目 sün'' cheung''-muk

To let fly an arrow 射箭 she''-tsin''

To cash a cheque 支銀單 chi ngān-tan

To give alms 施捨 shi-she''

Ball (shot) 彈子 tan''-tsz''

Do. 貧窮 p''ān-k''ung

To cast cannon balls 鑄彈子 chü'' tan''-tsz''

Air 天氣 t''in-hi''

Bachelor 未娶親 mi'' ts''ui'' ts''ăn

Arms 軍器 kwän-hi''

Barrel 琵琶桶 p''i-p''a-t''ung''

Do. 器械 hi''-hai''

Battle 打仗 ta''-cheung''

Bankruptcy 報窮 po''-k''ung

To lose a battle 打輸 ta''-shü

Baggage 行李 hang-li''

To win a battle 打贏 ta''-yeng

Ant 蟻 ngai''

Ball (for play) 毬 k''au

Yellow ants 黃蟻 wong-ngai''

To play at ball 打球 t''a'' k''au

White ants 白蟻 pak-ngai''

1 Has that person come from 嗰個人喺佛蘭西國 ko-ko yan hai Fat-lan-sai kwok

France? 來嘅咩 loi ke me?

2 He came from France the day 佢前日由佛蘭西國 k''ü ts''in-yat yau Fat-lan-sai

before yesterday 來嘅 kwok loi ke

3 Did you see those people 你近日有見個啲人 ni kān-yat yau kin ko-ti yan

