  ('cvh-189-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 189, 1, NULL, 'Thermomoter 寒暑針 hon-shu''-ch''am Flagstaff 旗杆 k''i-kom

Freight (cost of) 水脚銀 shu''i-keuk-ngän Ivory 象牙 tsung''-nga

Glue 牛皮膠 ngau-p''i-kau Intimate 心腹 sām-fuk

To draw up a list 開列 *hoi lit* Landing place 渡頭 *to''-t''au*

Lackered ware 漆器 ts''at-hi'' (wharf)

Fire-crackers 爆像 pau-tseung Light (the) 光 kwong

Grass-cloth 夏布 ha`''po'' Handle柄 ping''

Goat 草羊 ts''o''-young Frost霜 seung

Do. 山羊 shan-young Fog 霧 mo''

Flea狗虱 kau''-shat Grass草 ts''o''

Fly烏蠅 u-ying Heat 熱 it

1 What flag is that on the high 响枝高旗杆頂嘅旗 ko chi ko k''i-kon teng ke k''i hai flagstaff? 係乜野旗呢 mät-ye k''i ni?

2 There are certainly some 响個花園現時是必 ko-ko fa-ün in-shi shi-pit yan fa flowers in that garden now 有花

3 The Chinese are very fond of 唐人好中意爆像 T''ong-yan ho chung-i pau-tseung fire-crackers

4 Yesterday there was frost and 昨日有霜，如今有 tsok-yat yau seung, ü-kǔm yau now there is a fog 霧 mo

5 When the heat comes there 天時熱，就有烏蠅 t''in-shi it, tsau yau u-ying kung will be flies and fleas 共狗虱 kan-shat

6 Those flowers in the grass are 草內响啲花十分精 ts''o noi ko-ti fa shap-fän tsing- very beautiful 緻 chi

7 I want some glue to use for 我要的牛皮膠嚟整 ngo iu tik ngau-p''i-kau lai ching this chair 呢張椅 ni cheung i

8 My friend is the landlord of a 我嘅朋友係响一間 ngo ke p''ang-yau hai ko yat kan large garden 大花園嘅主人 tai fa-ün ke chü-yan

9 What amount of freight does 响隻船載貨有幾多 ko chek shün tsoi foh yau ki to that ship earn? 水脚銀呢 shui-keuk ngăn ni?

10 She will most likely bring 大概載好多象牙共 tai-k''oi tsoi ho to tseung-nga kung ivory and lackered-ware 漆器 ts''at-hi

11 Bring me a light; I want to see 拈個火嚟我, 我要 nim ko foh lai ngo; ngo iu t''ai the landing place (wharf) 睇吓渡頭 ha to-t''au', 'Thermomoter寒暑針hon-shu''-ch''amFlagstaff旗杆k''i-komFreight(costof)水脚銀shu''i-keuk-ngänIvory象牙tsung''-ngaGlue牛皮膠ngau-p''i-kauIntimate心腹sām-fukTodrawupalist開列*hoilit*Landingplace渡頭*to''-t''au*Lackeredware漆器ts''at-hi''(wharf)Fire-crackers爆像pau-tseungLight(the)光kwongGrass-cloth夏布ha`''po''Handle柄ping''Goat草羊ts''o''-youngFrost霜seungDo.山羊shan-youngFog霧mo''Flea狗虱kau''-shatGrass草ts''o''Fly烏蠅u-yingHeat熱it1Whatflagisthatonthehigh响枝高旗杆頂嘅旗kochikok''i-kontengkek''ihaiflagstaff?係乜野旗呢mät-yek''ini?2Therearecertainlysome响個花園現時是必ko-kofa-ünin-shishi-pityanfaflowersinthatgardennow有花3TheChineseareveryfondof唐人好中意爆像T''ong-yanhochung-ipau-tseungfire-crackers4Yesterdaytherewasfrostand昨日有霜，如今有tsok-yatyauseung,ü-kǔmyaunowthereisafog霧mo5Whentheheatcomesthere天時熱，就有烏蠅t''in-shiit,tsauyauu-yingkungwillbefliesandfleas共狗虱kan-shat6Thoseflowersinthegrassare草內响啲花十分精ts''onoiko-tifashap-fäntsing-verybeautiful緻chi7Iwantsomegluetousefor我要的牛皮膠嚟整ngoiutikngau-p''i-kaulaichingthischair呢張椅nicheungi8Myfriendisthelandlordofa我嘅朋友係响一間ngokep''ang-yauhaikoyatkanlargegarden大花園嘅主人taifa-ünkechü-yan9Whatamountoffreightdoes响隻船載貨有幾多kochekshüntsoifohyaukitothatshipearn?水脚銀呢shui-keukngănni?10Shewillmostlikelybring大概載好多象牙共tai-k''oitsoihototseung-ngakungivoryandlackered-ware漆器ts''at-hi11Bringmealight;Iwanttosee拈個火嚟我,我要nimkofohlaingo;ngoiut''aithelandingplace(wharf)睇吓渡頭hato-t''au', 'verified'),
  ('cvh-190-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 190, 1, NULL, '<table border="1"><tr><td>12 What kind of gauze is that?</td><td>個啲係乜野紗呢</td><td>ko-ti hai mat-ye sha ni?</td></tr><tr><td>13 The sky is (IIeavens are) very light</td><td>天十分光</td><td>t’in shap-fän kwong</td></tr><tr><td>14 That man has a large amount of gratitude</td><td>响個人好知恩嘅</td><td>ko-ko yan ho chi yan ke</td></tr><tr><td>15 I shall go out shooting when I have leisure</td><td>我得閒時就去打雀</td><td>ngo tāk han shi, tsau hüi ta tseuk</td></tr><tr><td>16 Have you any gunpowder here with you?</td><td>你呢處有火藥冇呢</td><td>ni ni-ch‘ü yau foli-yeuk mo ni?</td></tr><tr><td>17 Who was that touched the handle of the door?</td><td>乜誰摩响個門柄呢</td><td>mät-shui mo ko-ko mun-ping ni?</td></tr><tr><td>18 This grass-cloth is very good</td><td>呢啲夏布十分好</td><td>ni-ti ha-po shap-fän ho</td></tr><tr><td>19 When will you get that thermometer?</td><td>你幾時正攞得响枝寒暑針呢</td><td>ni ki shi ching loh tāk ko chi hon-shü-chǎm ni?</td></tr><tr><td>20 I do not know; I cannot tell you</td><td>我唔知得，唔話得你知</td><td>ngo ''m chi tāk；''m wa tāk ni chi</td></tr><tr><td>21 How do you expect the list will be arranged?</td><td>你估响張單點樣開列呢</td><td>ni ku ko cheung tan tim yeung hoi lit ni?</td></tr><tr><td>22 You have written that separately</td><td>你分開寫响啲</td><td>ni fàn hoi se ko-ti</td></tr><tr><td>23 You would have done it better unitedly</td><td>你應該合埋做好啲呀</td><td>ni ying-koi hop-mai tso ho ti a</td></tr><tr><td>24 Of late it was done very confusedly</td><td>近日整得好亂</td><td>kǎn-yat ching tāk ho liún</td></tr><tr><td>25 What tone did he say it in?</td><td>佢講乜野聲音呢</td><td>k‘ü kong mät-ye sheng-yàm ni?</td></tr><tr><td>26 I entirely forget; I have a bad memory</td><td>我總忘記嘥咯，我唔好記性</td><td>ngo tsung mong-ki sai lok, ngo ''m ho ki-sing</td></tr><tr><td>27 How many strokes were there in the character?</td><td>响個字有幾多畫呢</td><td>ko-ko tsz yau ki to wak ni?</td></tr><tr><td>28 I only saw it by moon-light</td><td>我獨係月光時睇見</td><td>ngo tuk hai yüt-kwong shi t‘ai kin</td></tr><tr><td>29 Is that pool of water deep or shallow</td><td>响個塘嘅水深或淺呢</td><td>ko-ko t‘ong ke shui shām wak ts‘in ni?</td></tr></table>', '<tableborder="1"><tr><td>12Whatkindofgauzeisthat?</td><td>個啲係乜野紗呢</td><td>ko-tihaimat-yeshani?</td></tr><tr><td>13Theskyis(IIeavensare)verylight</td><td>天十分光</td><td>t’inshap-fänkwong</td></tr><tr><td>14Thatmanhasalargeamountofgratitude</td><td>响個人好知恩嘅</td><td>ko-koyanhochiyanke</td></tr><tr><td>15IshallgooutshootingwhenIhaveleisure</td><td>我得閒時就去打雀</td><td>ngotākhanshi,tsauhüitatseuk</td></tr><tr><td>16Haveyouanygunpowderherewithyou?</td><td>你呢處有火藥冇呢</td><td>nini-ch‘üyaufoli-yeukmoni?</td></tr><tr><td>17Whowasthattouchedthehandleofthedoor?</td><td>乜誰摩响個門柄呢</td><td>mät-shuimoko-komun-pingni?</td></tr><tr><td>18Thisgrass-clothisverygood</td><td>呢啲夏布十分好</td><td>ni-tiha-poshap-fänho</td></tr><tr><td>19Whenwillyougetthatthermometer?</td><td>你幾時正攞得响枝寒暑針呢</td><td>nikishichinglohtākkochihon-shü-chǎmni?</td></tr><tr><td>20Idonotknow;Icannottellyou</td><td>我唔知得，唔話得你知</td><td>ngo''mchitāk；''mwatāknichi</td></tr><tr><td>21Howdoyouexpectthelistwillbearranged?</td><td>你估响張單點樣開列呢</td><td>nikukocheungtantimyeunghoilitni?</td></tr><tr><td>22Youhavewrittenthatseparately</td><td>你分開寫响啲</td><td>nifànhoiseko-ti</td></tr><tr><td>23Youwouldhavedoneitbetterunitedly</td><td>你應該合埋做好啲呀</td><td>niying-koihop-maitsohotia</td></tr><tr><td>24Oflateitwasdoneveryconfusedly</td><td>近日整得好亂</td><td>kǎn-yatchingtākholiún</td></tr><tr><td>25Whattonedidhesayitin?</td><td>佢講乜野聲音呢</td><td>k‘ükongmät-yesheng-yàmni?</td></tr><tr><td>26Ientirelyforget;Ihaveabadmemory</td><td>我總忘記嘥咯，我唔好記性</td><td>ngotsungmong-kisailok,ngo''mhoki-sing</td></tr><tr><td>27Howmanystrokeswerethereinthecharacter?</td><td>响個字有幾多畫呢</td><td>ko-kotszyaukitowakni?</td></tr><tr><td>28Ionlysawitbymoon-light</td><td>我獨係月光時睇見</td><td>ngotukhaiyüt-kwongshit‘aikin</td></tr><tr><td>29Isthatpoolofwaterdeeporshallow</td><td>响個塘嘅水深或淺呢</td><td>ko-kot‘ongkeshuishāmwakts‘inni?</td></tr></table>', 'verified'),
  ('cvh-191-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 191, 1, NULL, '<table border="1"><tr><td>30 That man is one-eyed, but it is not his fault</td><td>响個人係單眼嘅, 但唔係佢嘅錯</td><td>ko-ko yan hai tan-ngan ke, tan ''m hai k''ü ke ts''oh</td></tr><tr><td>31 When did you turn over the leaves of that book?</td><td>你幾時翻轉個本書頁呀</td><td>ni ki shi fan-chün ko pun shü-ip a?</td></tr><tr><td>32 I really do not remember when I saw it</td><td>我真唔記得幾時見過</td><td>ngo chän ''m ki täk ki shi kin kwo</td></tr><tr><td>33 That man is very deaf</td><td>响個人耳十分聾</td><td>ko-ko yan i shap-tän lung</td></tr><tr><td>34 When were you last not very well?</td><td>你先囇幾時唔多自然呀</td><td>ni sin pin ki shi ''n to tsz-in a?</td></tr><tr><td>35 About nine mouths ago when I had small pox</td><td>大約九個月前我出痘响時</td><td>tai-yeuk kau ko üt ts''in ngo ch''ut tau ko shi</td></tr><tr><td>36 What time is it by the clock now?</td><td>如今個鐘幾多點呢</td><td>ü-käm ko chung ki to tim ni?</td></tr><tr><td>37 I much wish the time would not go so quickly</td><td>我真正想時候咪去咁快</td><td>ngo chän ching seung shi-hau mai hü kom fai</td></tr><tr><td>38 I think it is not yet twelve o&#x27;clock</td><td>我估未有十二點咍</td><td>ngo ku mi yau shap-i tim chi</td></tr><tr><td>39 There are six flags up now on the flagstaff</td><td>如今旗杆頂有六枝旗</td><td>ü-käm k&#x27;i-kon ting yau luk chi k&#x27;i</td></tr><tr><td>40 They will presently fire some gunpowder</td><td>佢哋就燒啲火藥咯</td><td>k&#x27;ü-ti tsau shiu ti foh-yeuk lok</td></tr></table>', '<tableborder="1"><tr><td>30Thatmanisone-eyed,butitisnothisfault</td><td>响個人係單眼嘅,但唔係佢嘅錯</td><td>ko-koyanhaitan-nganke,tan''mhaik''ükets''oh</td></tr><tr><td>31Whendidyouturnovertheleavesofthatbook?</td><td>你幾時翻轉個本書頁呀</td><td>nikishifan-chünkopunshü-ipa?</td></tr><tr><td>32IreallydonotrememberwhenIsawit</td><td>我真唔記得幾時見過</td><td>ngochän''mkitäkkishikinkwo</td></tr><tr><td>33Thatmanisverydeaf</td><td>响個人耳十分聾</td><td>ko-koyanishap-tänlung</td></tr><tr><td>34Whenwereyoulastnotverywell?</td><td>你先囇幾時唔多自然呀</td><td>nisinpinkishi''ntotsz-ina?</td></tr><tr><td>35AboutninemouthsagowhenIhadsmallpox</td><td>大約九個月前我出痘响時</td><td>tai-yeukkaukoütts''inngoch''uttaukoshi</td></tr><tr><td>36Whattimeisitbytheclocknow?</td><td>如今個鐘幾多點呢</td><td>ü-kämkochungkitotimni?</td></tr><tr><td>37Imuchwishthetimewouldnotgosoquickly</td><td>我真正想時候咪去咁快</td><td>ngochänchingseungshi-haumaihükomfai</td></tr><tr><td>38Ithinkitisnotyettwelveo&#x27;clock</td><td>我估未有十二點咍</td><td>ngokumiyaushap-itimchi</td></tr><tr><td>39Therearesixflagsupnowontheflagstaff</td><td>如今旗杆頂有六枝旗</td><td>ü-kämk&#x27;i-kontingyaulukchik&#x27;i</td></tr><tr><td>40Theywillpresentlyfiresomegunpowder</td><td>佢哋就燒啲火藥咯</td><td>k&#x27;ü-titsaushiutifoh-yeuklok</td></tr></table>', 'needs_review'),
  ('cvh-191-02', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 191, 2, 'PREPOSITIONS.', '<table><tr><td>About (just going to)</td><td>將</td><td>tseung</td><td>Besides</td><td>另外</td><td>ling` ngoi`</td></tr><tr><td>About (concerning)</td><td>及</td><td>k&#x27;ap</td><td>Do.</td><td>而且</td><td>i-ch&#x27;e</td></tr><tr><td>About (nearly)</td><td>上吓</td><td>sheung&#x27;-ha&#x27;</td><td>Amongst</td><td>中間</td><td>chung-kan</td></tr><tr><td>Across</td><td>橫,過</td><td>wang, kwo&#x27;</td><td>Amidst</td><td>中</td><td>chung</td></tr><tr><td>Below</td><td>下便</td><td>ha&#x27;-pin&#x27;</td><td>Beyond</td><td>格外</td><td>kak-ngoi&#x27;</td></tr></table>', '<table><tr><td>About(justgoingto)</td><td>將</td><td>tseung</td><td>Besides</td><td>另外</td><td>ling`ngoi`</td></tr><tr><td>About(concerning)</td><td>及</td><td>k&#x27;ap</td><td>Do.</td><td>而且</td><td>i-ch&#x27;e</td></tr><tr><td>About(nearly)</td><td>上吓</td><td>sheung&#x27;-ha&#x27;</td><td>Amongst</td><td>中間</td><td>chung-kan</td></tr><tr><td>Across</td><td>橫,過</td><td>wang,kwo&#x27;</td><td>Amidst</td><td>中</td><td>chung</td></tr><tr><td>Below</td><td>下便</td><td>ha&#x27;-pin&#x27;</td><td>Beyond</td><td>格外</td><td>kak-ngoi&#x27;</td></tr></table>', 'needs_review'),
  ('cvh-192-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 192, 1, NULL, '<table><tr><td>According to</td><td>照依</td><td>chin`-i</td><td colspan="2">After (lit. to fallow)</td><td>跟</td><td>kǎn</td></tr><tr><td>At present</td><td>現在</td><td>in`-tsoi</td><td colspan="2">Against</td><td>嗌</td><td>ngak</td></tr><tr><td>At home</td><td>在家</td><td>tsoi` ka</td><td colspan="2">Beyond</td><td>過</td><td>kwoh</td></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan="2">By what means?</td><td rowspan="2" colspan="2">用乜法呢<br>論斤賣</td><td colspan="2">yung` māt fat ni?</td></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan="2">To sell by the catty</td><td colspan="2">lun` kǎn mai</td></tr></table>

