1 I hear that there is a monkey 我聞得响處有隻馬 ngo măn tăk ko-ch''ü yau chek at that place 騮 ma-lau

2 About how much will it cost 大約要幾多錢正養 tai yeuk iu ki to ts''in ching yeung to feed it? 得佢呢 täk k''ü ni?

3 Will you go to see it? 你去睇响啲咩 ni hü t''ai ko-ti me?

4 That will be according to the 照依天時嚟奏 chiu-i t''in-shi lai ts''au weather

5 Do you know whether you 你知到你在屋裡嚟 ni chi to ni tsoi uk li lai ''m a? will be at home? 唔呀

6 I shall be for the present; 現時在, 而且我失 in-shi tsoi; i-ch''e ngo shat ko-

besides, I cannot miss 响啲的樂音 ti ngok-yǎm ''m

the music 唔好 ho

7 I want to write to him because 我要寫信過佢因爲 ngo iu se sun kwo k''ü yan-wai of the mistake 响啲錯處 ko-ti ts''oh ch''ü

8 You must not let the mud get 你唔好俾啲泥整親 ni ''m ho pi ti nai ching ts''ăn ni on your clothes 你嘅衫 ke sham

