11 What is that writing below the 响個暗號下底寫乜 ko-ko om-ho ha-tai se măt-ye tsz private mark? 野字嚟呢 lai ni?

12 That remark might have been 或者响句係冇乜意 wak-che ko kü hai mo măt i-sz without meaning思嘅 ke

13 The Chinese do a good deal of money-changing 唐人好多做找換嘅生意 T''ong-yan ho to tso chau-un ke shang-i

14 The moon is always bright 呢陣時個月常時係 ni-chan shi ko üt sheung-shi hai just now 好光 ho kwong

15 The mosquitos are very trouble-個啲蚊係十分煩擾 ko-ti mān hai shap-fān fan-iu;

some; I must use a net 我要用個網 ngo iu yung ko mong

