  ('cvh-195-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 195, 1, NULL, '26 I was very fond of play when 我細蚊仔時好反斗 ngo sai-măn-tsai shi ho fan-tau

I was a boy 嘅 ko

27 Do you like poetry? I some- 你中意詩唔呢, 我 ni chung-i shi ''m ni? ngo yau-shi times make verses 有時吟詩 yǎm shi

28 No; I do not, though many 唔中意,唔噲,雖係 ''m chung-i; ''m ui, sui hai ho people do 好多人噲 to yau ui

29 Have you ever seen a man 你有見過人服毒藥 ni yau kin kwo yan fuk tuk-yeuk take poison? 冇呢 mo ni?

30 The Chinese are very polite 唐人大家十分好禮 T''ong-yan tai-ka shap-fan ho lai-

(to each other) 數 sho

31 Have you received your port 你有接到放行紙冇 ni yau tsip to fong-hang-chi mo clearance yet? 呢 ni?

32 No; they would not give it me 冇, 佢哋唔肯俾我 mo, k''ü-ti ''m hang pi ngo

33 What is the postage of a letter 寄封信去英國要幾 ki fung sun hü Ying-kwok iu ki to England? 多信資呢 to sun-tsze ni?

34 I think it is about thirty 我估要三十個先士, ngo ku iu sam-shap-ko sin-sz, wak

cents, perhaps it may 或者重要多啲 che chung iu to ti to

be more 都唔定 ''m ting

35 Has there been any fire lately 香港近日有火燭冇 Heung-kong kán-yat yau foh-chuk in Hong-kong ? 呢 mo ni?

36 There was a small one last昨夜有小小火燭 tsok-ye yau siu-siu foh-chuk night啫 che

37 Do you use warm water for 如今你重用煖水洗 ü-käm ni chung yung nün-shui sai washing your face now? 面唔呢 min ''m ni？

