你父親點樣揾翻嚟呢。', 'Whoisitthatdressesyouandfeedsyou?Yourdearmother.Buthowdoesyourmothergetmoneytobuytheclothes,andthefood?Fathergivesither.Howdoesyourfathergetmoney?乜誰俾飯你食,俾衫你着呢,係老母咯。你老母點樣有錢買過你食,買過你着呢,係父親揾翻嚟嘅。你父親點樣揾翻嚟呢。', 'verified'),
