  ('rcc-062-01', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 62, 1, NULL, '''Come,'' said the angels, ''and look at the place where Jesus lay. Run quickly, and tell his disciples that Jesus is alive, and that they shall see him very soon.''

The women were very glad indeed they ran as quickly as they could to tell the disciples.—''Peep of Day,'' pp. 178,179.

