  ('rcc-064-01', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 64, 1, 'LESSON, XII.', 'The Ten Commandments.

The First Commandment.—

God said, ''Thou shalt have no other God before me.''

The Second Commandment.—

''Thou shalt not make unto thee any graven image, or any likeness of anything that is in heaven above, or that is in the earth beneath, or that is in the water under the earth: thou shalt not bow down thyself to them, nor serve them: for I the Lord thy God am a jealous God, visiting the iniquity of the fathers upon the children unto the third and fourth generation of them that hate me; and shewing mercy unto thousands of them that love me, and keep my commandments.

The Third Commandment.—

''Thou shalt not take the name of thy Lord in vain; for the Lord will not hold him guiltless that taketh his name in vain.''', 'TheTenCommandments.TheFirstCommandment.—Godsaid,''ThoushalthavenootherGodbeforeme.''TheSecondCommandment.—''Thoushaltnotmakeuntotheeanygravenimage,oranylikenessofanythingthatisinheavenabove,orthatisintheearthbeneath,orthatisinthewaterundertheearth:thoushaltnotbowdownthyselftothem,norservethem:forItheLordthyGodamajealousGod,visitingtheiniquityofthefathersuponthechildrenuntothethirdandfourthgenerationofthemthathateme;andshewingmercyuntothousandsofthemthatloveme,andkeepmycommandments.TheThirdCommandment.—''ThoushaltnottakethenameofthyLordinvain;fortheLordwillnotholdhimguiltlessthattakethhisnameinvain.''', 'needs_review'),
  ('rcc-064-02', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 64, 2, '第一誡。', '神話,除曉我之外,你唔好有別個神。', '神話,除曉我之外,你唔好有別個神。', 'needs_review'),
  ('rcc-064-03', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 64, 3, '第二誡。', '你唔好雕刻偶像,學翻天上地下,共地下水中各物嘅樣子,你唔好拜佢,而且服事佢,因爲我耶和華係你嘅神,不容你拜別個神,憎我嘅[我就]罰佢嘅罪,自祖父到子孫三四代,愛我嘅,守我誡嘅,就施恩過佢到千百代。', '你唔好雕刻偶像,學翻天上地下,共地下水中各物嘅樣子,你唔好拜佢,而且服事佢,因爲我耶和華係你嘅神,不容你拜別個神,憎我嘅[我就]罰佢嘅罪,自祖父到子孫三四代,愛我嘅,守我誡嘅,就施恩過佢到千百代。', 'needs_review'),
