  ('rcc-072-01', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 72, 1, NULL, 'In his dream he saw the sun, moon, and eleven stars worshipping him. Joseph told this dream to his father and brothers. When Jacob heard these things, he did not know exactly what they meant, but he thought about them all the time. Joseph''s brothers were still more angry with him.

Jacob''s twelve sons were shepherds; they always helped their father by looking after sheep. The ten grownup sons of Jacob took the sheep once to Shechem to feed; but Joseph and Benjamin did not go.

One day Israel, that is Jacob, called Joseph and said to him, ''I want you to go now and see how your brothers are getting on with the sheep at pasture, and then come back and give me an answer.''

夢見日月共有十一粒星拜自己,約瑟又講過父親兄弟聽,雅各聽見呢啲事,就幾分曉得意思,喺心處不歇想起,佢嘅兄弟越發嬲咯。

Joseph went at once as soon as his father told him to go. Perhaps he was a bit afraid at first when his father told him to go, because his brothers were so angry with him. He knew that he ought to obey his father; and he knew that God could take care of him, so he went at once.

雅各十二個仔,係看羊嘅,時時帮父親看羊,有一排個十個長大嘅仔,帶個啲羊去示劍處養,約瑟同便雅憫就唔去。

一日以色列,即係雅各,叫約瑟噉話,我而家要你去睇吓你啲兄弟養得啲生口點,就翻嚟俾聲氣過我。

約瑟聽見父親噉吩咐,即時就去,或者佢興工聽父親叫個陣時,慌慌哋都唔定,因爲佢兄弟噉嬲佢,佢都知到應該要聽父親話,又知到神有能保佑佢,故此即刻去。', 'Inhisdreamhesawthesun,moon,andelevenstarsworshippinghim.Josephtoldthisdreamtohisfatherandbrothers.WhenJacobheardthesethings,hedidnotknowexactlywhattheymeant,buthethoughtaboutthemallthetime.Joseph''sbrotherswerestillmoreangrywithhim.Jacob''stwelvesonswereshepherds;theyalwayshelpedtheirfatherbylookingaftersheep.ThetengrownupsonsofJacobtookthesheeponcetoShechemtofeed;butJosephandBenjamindidnotgo.OnedayIsrael,thatisJacob,calledJosephandsaidtohim,''Iwantyoutogonowandseehowyourbrothersaregettingonwiththesheepatpasture,andthencomebackandgivemeananswer.''夢見日月共有十一粒星拜自己,約瑟又講過父親兄弟聽,雅各聽見呢啲事,就幾分曉得意思,喺心處不歇想起,佢嘅兄弟越發嬲咯。Josephwentatonceassoonashisfathertoldhimtogo.Perhapshewasabitafraidatfirstwhenhisfathertoldhimtogo,becausehisbrothersweresoangrywithhim.Heknewthatheoughttoobeyhisfather;andheknewthatGodcouldtakecareofhim,sohewentatonce.雅各十二個仔,係看羊嘅,時時帮父親看羊,有一排個十個長大嘅仔,帶個啲羊去示劍處養,約瑟同便雅憫就唔去。一日以色列,即係雅各,叫約瑟噉話,我而家要你去睇吓你啲兄弟養得啲生口點,就翻嚟俾聲氣過我。約瑟聽見父親噉吩咐,即時就去,或者佢興工聽父親叫個陣時,慌慌哋都唔定,因爲佢兄弟噉嬲佢,佢都知到應該要聽父親話,又知到神有能保佑佢,故此即刻去。', 'needs_review'),
  ('rcc-073-01', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 73, 1, NULL, 'Mung² kín¹ yat₂, yüt₂, kung² yau shap₂-yat nap₂ sing pai¹ tsz²-kei. Yök₂-shat yan² kong kwo fú²-ts''an hing-taí² te''ng†. Ngá-kok t''eng† kín¹ ni-ti sz², tsan² kei fan híu tak yi''-sz'', hai sam shü pat hít. söng hei. K''öü-ke hing-tai² yüt₂-fát₀ nau lok₀.

