One day Israel, that is Jacob, called Joseph so said, ''I now want you to-go see a bit your brothers rearing the live stock (lit. live mouths) how, then back come give answer to me.''

Joseph hearing (his) father so direct, immediately then went. Perhaps he at first hearing (his) father telling at that time frightened a bit, also not certain (i.e. he was very likely a bit frightened), because his brothers so angry-at him. He also knew by-rights ought to-obey (bis) father''s words; Further (he) knew God had power to-protect him, therefore (he) immediately went.', 'Mung²kín¹yat₂,yüt₂,kung²yaushap₂-yatnap₂singpai¹tsz²-kei.Yök₂-shatyan²kongkwofú²-ts''anhing-taí²te''ng†.Ngá-kokt''eng†kín¹ni-tisz²,tsan²keifanhíutakyi''-sz'',haisamshüpathít.sönghei.K''öü-kehing-tai²yüt₂-fát₀naulok₀.Ngá-kok,shap$_2$-yi$^2$ko''tsaihai$^2$honyöngke$^2$;shi-shipongfú$^2$-ts''anhonyöng.Yauyat,$^3$p''ai*koshap$_2$ko''chöng-tái$^2$ke''tsaitáiko''-tiyönghuíShi$^2$-kim$^2$shüyöng.Yök$_2$-shat,$^3$t''ungPin$^2$-ngá-mantsau$^2$mhuì.Yat,yat$_{2}$''Yi-shik,-lit$_{2}$,tsik,hai$_{2}$''Ngá-kok$_{0}$,kiu''Yök,-shat$_{2}$''komwa$_{2}$,''Ngoyí-kayiú''''neihui''''t''aihá''nei-tihing-tai$_{2}$''yöngtak$_{2}$tisháng-''hau''tim,tsau$_{2}$fánlai''peisheng†-hei''kwo$_{2}$ngo.''Yök₂-shat,t''eng†-kin''fu²-ts''ankòmfan-fú²,tsik₂-shitsau²hui.Wák₂-ch''ek''öühing-kungt''eng†fú²-ts''ankiú²ko²chan²shifong-fong-téi*tòmting²,yan-wai²k''öühing-tai²kòm²nauk''öü.K''öütòchí-to²ying-koiyiú²t''eng†fú²-ts''anwá²;yau²chí-to²Shanyaunangpó-yau²k''öü,kwu²-t''sztsik₂hak,huì.(Inhis)dream(he)sawsun,moon,together-withthere-wereeleven$[C.]$starsworshippinghim.Josephagainspoketo(his)fatherbrothersto-hear.Jacobhearingthesemattersthenseveraltenthsunderstandablemeaning,inheartplacewithoutceasingthink.Hisbrothersstillmoreangry,32.Jacob''stwelvesonswereshepherds,alwayshelped(their)fatherto-watchsheep.Therewasoncetheten$[C.]$grown-upsonsledthesheepaway-toShechemplacetofeed(them).JosephwithBenjaminthennotgo.OnedayIsrael,thatisJacob,calledJosephsosaid,''Inowwantyouto-goseeabityourbrothersrearingthelivestock(lit.livemouths)how,thenbackcomegiveanswertome.''Josephhearing(his)fathersodirect,immediatelythenwent.Perhapsheatfirsthearing