  ('rcc-074-01', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 74, 1, NULL, 'Joseph started from Hebron and when he got to Shechem he could not find his brothers. A man then told him, ‘Your brothers have gone to Dothan; you will find them there.’

約瑟離開希伯崙,去到示劍個處,唔搵得倒兄弟,個陣有個人話佢聽,你兄弟去曉多丹處,喺個處搵得着佢。

When some of Joseph’s brothers saw him coming, they said, ‘The dreamer is coming. Let us kill him, and throw his body into a pit; when we go home we can say to his father that a wild beast has eaten him up; and then we shall see whether his dreams will come to pass or not.’

有幾個兄弟見約瑟嚟緊,就噉話,個發夢嘅嚟緊咯,殺佢喇,掟佢屍落坑處,等去歸至話過父親聽,話有一隻惡獸食曉佢,後來睇吓佢發夢的事有應驗冇。

But Reuben said, ‘Do not kill him, but throw him into this pit.’ Reuben was not so wicked as his brothers. He wanted to put him into the pit, then wait till all his brothers had gone away, when he would take him out again and give him back to his father.

流便話,唔好殺佢,掟佢落呢個坑處,流便唔同個啲兄弟咁黑心,佢想擠佢落坑處,等各兄弟行開個陣時,就羅佢翻出嚟,交回父親。

When Joseph got to his brothers, they seized him, took off his coat of many colours and threw him into a pit. It was a good thing there was no water in the pit; it was dry.

約瑟嚟到個時,佢啲兄弟捉到佢,除佢件花衫,掟佢落坑處,好彩個坑有水喺處,係乾嘅。', 'JosephstartedfromHebronandwhenhegottoShechemhecouldnotfindhisbrothers.Amanthentoldhim,‘YourbrothershavegonetoDothan;youwillfindthemthere.’約瑟離開希伯崙,去到示劍個處,唔搵得倒兄弟,個陣有個人話佢聽,你兄弟去曉多丹處,喺個處搵得着佢。WhensomeofJoseph’sbrotherssawhimcoming,theysaid,‘Thedreameriscoming.Letuskillhim,andthrowhisbodyintoapit;whenwegohomewecansaytohisfatherthatawildbeasthaseatenhimup;andthenweshallseewhetherhisdreamswillcometopassornot.’有幾個兄弟見約瑟嚟緊,就噉話,個發夢嘅嚟緊咯,殺佢喇,掟佢屍落坑處,等去歸至話過父親聽,話有一隻惡獸食曉佢,後來睇吓佢發夢的事有應驗冇。ButReubensaid,‘Donotkillhim,butthrowhimintothispit.’Reubenwasnotsowickedashisbrothers.Hewantedtoputhimintothepit,thenwaittillallhisbrothershadgoneaway,whenhewouldtakehimoutagainandgivehimbacktohisfather.流便話,唔好殺佢,掟佢落呢個坑處,流便唔同個啲兄弟咁黑心,佢想擠佢落坑處,等各兄弟行開個陣時,就羅佢翻出嚟,交回父親。WhenJosephgottohisbrothers,theyseizedhim,tookoffhiscoatofmanycoloursandthrewhimintoapit.Itwasagoodthingtherewasnowaterinthepit;itwasdry.約瑟嚟到個時,佢啲兄弟捉到佢,除佢件花衫,掟佢落坑處,好彩個坑有水喺處,係乾嘅。', 'needs_review'),
  ('rcc-075-01', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 75, 1, NULL, 'Yök- shat, léi- hoi Héi-pak-lun hui to Shi²- kim'' ko'' shu'', m wan tak ''to hing-tai². Ko'' chan² yau ko'' yan wa² k''öü t''eng†, ''Néi hing-tai² hui'' hiú To- tán shu'', hai ko'' shu'' wan tak, chok. k''öü.''

