He now invites you to come. Perhaps you fear self, so many sins wickednesses not enter can; then must repent-of sins; change wickednesses; change-turn that [C.] heart (and) bowels: afterwards then enter can. Heaven''s place one bit also is holy pure matter. At that place live ones, every one also is good man; therefore you not yet repent change, although enter have heaven, your heart absolutely not attain peace; because heaven''s matters all also with your heart not same. You not much pleased worship true God; further not love him; not like Jesus''s holy doctrine; perceive holy book no taste; speak gospel (i.e. preaching) feel not good to-hear; feel prayer not detain heart: so fashion, the heart is filthy then not enter can heaven, 21. You must repent change, then obtain Holy Spirit convert your heart, then called to-be new heart, also called to-be again born over.', 'K''öüyi-kaimts''eng†neilaí.Wak-cheneip''atsz²-keikòm''totsui²-okmyaptak,tsau²yiúfui²-tsui²koiok,wün²-ehünko''fuksamch''ong;yín-hau²chi''yap-tak.T''in-t''ongshu'',yattitohai²shing-kitke''sz²;haikoshu''chü''ke'',ko-''ko''tohai²shin²yan;kwu''-ts''zneimei²-ts''angfui''-koi,suiyaphiu''tin-t''ong,neisamtsungmtakon-lok,yan-wai²t''in-t''ongke''sz²,yattitokung²neisammt''ung.Neimtofun-heipaichanShan;yau²moi''k''öü;mchung-yiYe-soke''shin²-to²;kinShing-shu''moméi²;kongfuk-yam,kin''mho''teng†;kin''k''éi-t''omlau-sam:''kòmyön*ko''samhai²o-tsò-ke''(orwu-tsò-ke''),tsau²myaptak,t''in-t''ongla.Néiyiúfui''-koi,tsau²tak,Shing''-ling''kòm-fa''neisam,tsau²kiu''tso²sansam,yau²kiu''tso²tsoich''ut,shaïkwo''.Henowinvitesyoutocome.Perhapsyoufearself,somanysinswickednessesnotentercan;thenmustrepent-ofsins;changewickednesses;change-turnthat[C.]heart(and)bowels:afterwardsthenentercan.Heaven''splaceonebitalsoisholypurematter.Atthatplaceliveones,everyonealsoisgoodman;thereforeyounotyetrepentchange,althoughenterhaveheaven,yourheartabsolutelynotattainpeace;becauseheaven''smattersallalsowithyourheartnotsame.YounotmuchpleasedworshiptrueG